    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">febrīcŭlōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um. adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Feverish</i>, <i>sick of a fever</i>
			(rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scortum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat. 6,
					4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morbus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 20, 1, 27</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>producing fever</i>, <i>febrific</i>, <i><span class="en">Front. de
				Or. 1</span></i> ed. Mai.</div>
